</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Post hoc main time effect</td><td colspan="2" rowspan="1">Experimental group: <italic>t</italic><sub>8</sub>=&#x02013;2.17; control group: <italic>t</italic><sub>8</sub>=&#x02013;1.63</td><td colspan="2" rowspan="1">Experimental group: 1-tailed <italic>P</italic>=.03; control group: 1-tailed <italic>P</italic>=.93</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
